{"unit_id":4,"stage_id":4,"lesson":{"lesson_id":12,"lesson_key":"S4L12","stage_id":4,"title":"Huroof ke saath Zameer Mu'annas: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Huroof ke saath Zameer Mu'annas: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا","en":"Particles Fused with 3rd Fem. Pronoun: لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا","ur":"حروف کے ساتھ ضمیرِ مؤنث: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا","hi":"हुरूफ़ के साथ ज़मीर मुअन्नस: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا"},"arabic_Focus":"لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي ← لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا","hinglish_Focus":"Ke liye, se, mein → Uske liye, us-se, usmein","page_numbers":"27–29","book_page":27,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي ← لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا","hinglish":"Ke liye, se, mein → Uske liye, us-se, usmein","arabic_word":"لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي","arabic_combined":"لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي ← لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا","hinglish_word":"Ke liye, se, mein","hinglish_combined":"Ke liye, se, mein → Uske liye, us-se, usmein","title_en":"Huroof ke saath Zameer Mu'annas: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا","subtitle":"Unit 4 • Lesson 12 (Book Page 27–29)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي","after_ar":"لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا","before_hi":"Ke liye, se, mein","after_hi":"Uske liye, us-se, usmein"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S4L12 — Huroof ke saath Zameer Mu'annas: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S4L12 — Huroof ke saath Zameer Mu'annas: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["لِـ / مِنْ / عَنْ + ـهَا","لَهَا / مِنْهَا / عَنْهَا","Uske liye / Usmein se / Us-se"],["فِي / إِلَىٰ / عَلَىٰ / بِـ + ـهَا","فِيهَا / إِلَيْهَا / عَلَيْهَا / بِهَا","Usmein (Jannat/Dunya mein) / Uski taraf / Us par / Uske saath"],["إِنَّ / أَنَّ / كَأَنَّ + ـهَا","إِنَّهَا / أَنَّهَا / كَأَنَّهَا","Beshak woh / Ke woh / Goya woh"]]}},{"id":"sec_s4l12_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 12</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Huroof ke saath Zameer Mu'annas: لِـ ← لَهَا ، مِنْ ← مِنْهَا ، فِي ← فِيهَا (Page 27–29)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Huroof + ـهَا</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• لِـ ، مِنْ ، فِي (Ke liye, se, mein) se لَهَا ، مِنْهَا ، فِيهَا (Uske liye, us-se, usmein) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 27–29):** Huroof ke saath `ـهَا` milne se `لَهَا` (uske liye), `مِنْهَا` (us-se), `فِيهَا` (usmein — jaise Jannat, Jahannam ya Zameen mein: `خَالِدِينَ فِيهَا`), `عَلَيْهَا` (us par: `لَهَا مَا كَسَبَتْ وَعَلَيْهَا مَا اكْتَسَبَتْ`), aur `إِنَّهَا` (beshak woh) bante hain."}},{"id":"sec_s4l12_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail Quranic fiqron ka tarjuma khud kijiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s4l12_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Jab huroof (li, min, fii, inna waghera) ke saath muannath zameer 'ـهَا' jodi jaati hai toh mukhtalif ma'ani bante hain: لَهَا (us aurat ke liye), مِنْهَا (us se), فِيهَا (us mein), إِنَّهَا (beshak woh aurat)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l12_s3","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l12_s3_s1","arabic":"قَلَمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَلَمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Qalam","translations":{"en":"A pen","ur":"ایک قلم","hi":"एक क़लम"},"displayOrder":1},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s2","arabic":"قَلَمُهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَلَمُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uska qalam","translations":{"en":"Her pen","ur":"اس کا قلم","hi":"उसका क़लम"},"displayOrder":2},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s3","arabic":"إِنَّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak","translations":{"en":"Indeed","ur":"بیشک","hi":"बेशक"},"displayOrder":3},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s4","arabic":"إِنَّهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak woh","translations":{"en":"Indeed, it is","ur":"بیشک وہ","hi":"बेशक वह"},"displayOrder":4},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s5","arabic":"أَنَّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَنَّ</span>","hinglish":"Ke","translations":{"en":"That","ur":"کہ","hi":"कि"},"displayOrder":5},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s6","arabic":"أَنَّهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَنَّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Ke woh","translations":{"en":"That it is","ur":"کہ وہ","hi":"कि वह"},"displayOrder":6},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s7","arabic":"مِنْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْ</span>","hinglish":"Se","translations":{"en":"From","ur":"سے","hi":"से"},"displayOrder":7},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s8","arabic":"مِنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Us se","translations":{"en":"From it / From her","ur":"اس سے","hi":"उससे"},"displayOrder":8},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s9","arabic":"لِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لِ</span>","hinglish":"Liye","translations":{"en":"For","ur":"کے لیے","hi":"के लिए"},"displayOrder":9},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s10","arabic":"لَهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uske liye","translations":{"en":"For her / For it","ur":"اس کے لیے","hi":"उसके लिए"},"displayOrder":10},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s11","arabic":"إِلَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Ki taraf","translations":{"en":"To / Toward","ur":"کی طرف","hi":"की तरफ़"},"displayOrder":11},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s12","arabic":"إِلَيْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَيْ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uski taraf","translations":{"en":"To it / Toward her","ur":"اس کی طرف","hi":"उसकी तरफ़"},"displayOrder":12},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s13","arabic":"عَلَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Par","translations":{"en":"On / Upon","ur":"پر","hi":"पर"},"displayOrder":13},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s14","arabic":"عَلَيْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَيْ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Us par","translations":{"en":"Upon it","ur":"اس پر","hi":"उस पर"},"displayOrder":14},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s15","arabic":"فِي","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي</span>","hinglish":"Mein","translations":{"en":"In","ur":"میں","hi":"में"},"displayOrder":15},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s16","arabic":"فِيهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein","translations":{"en":"In it / Therein","ur":"اس میں","hi":"उसमें"},"displayOrder":16},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s17","arabic":"عَنْ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَنْ</span>","hinglish":"Bare mein","translations":{"en":"About / Concerning","ur":"کے بارے میں","hi":"के बारे में"},"displayOrder":17},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s18","arabic":"عَنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَنْ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Uske bare mein","translations":{"en":"About it / From it","ur":"اس کے بارے میں","hi":"उसके बारे में"},"displayOrder":18}],"cols":2}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Qur'ani Qat'on ka Tarjuma:","title":"Qur'ani Qat'on ka Tarjuma"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":3,"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l12_s3_s19","arabic":"فِيهَا / الْفَسَادَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِيهَا / الْفَسَادَ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein fasaad","translations":{"en":"Corruption in it","ur":"اس میں فساد","hi":"उसमें फ़साद"},"displayOrder":1},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s20","arabic":"فِيهَا / الْمَوْتَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِيهَا / الْمَوْتَ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein maut","translations":{"en":"Death in it","ur":"اس میں موت","hi":"उसमें मौत"},"displayOrder":2},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s21","arabic":"فِيهَا / الْقِتَالُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقِتَالُ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein qitaal","translations":{"en":"Fighting in it","ur":"اس میں قتال (لڑائی)","hi":"उसमें क़िताल (लड़ाई)"},"displayOrder":3},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s22","arabic":"فِيهَا / بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein bina hisab ke","translations":{"en":"Therein without account","ur":"اس میں بغیر حساب کے","hi":"उसमें बिना हिसाब के"},"displayOrder":4,"ref":"40:40"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s23","arabic":"فِيهَا / آيَةً","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِيهَا / آيَةً</span>","hinglish":"Us mein nishani","translations":{"en":"In it is a sign","ur":"اس میں نشانی ہے","hi":"उसमें निशानी है"},"displayOrder":5},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s24","arabic":"فِيهَا / جِدَارًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">جِدَارًا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein deewar","translations":{"en":"In it a wall","ur":"اس میں ایک دیوار","hi":"उसमें एक दीवार"},"displayOrder":6},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s25","arabic":"فِيهَا / حُسْنًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">حُسْنًا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein khoobsoorti","translations":{"en":"In it goodness","ur":"اس میں خوبصورتی (بھلائی)","hi":"उसमें ख़ूबसूरती (भलाई)"},"displayOrder":7},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s26","arabic":"عَلَيْهَا / حِجَارَةً","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">حِجَارَةً</span>","hinglish":"Us par patthar","translations":{"en":"Upon it stones","ur":"اس پر پتھر","hi":"उस पर पत्थर"},"displayOrder":8},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s27","arabic":"عَلَيْهَا / الْمَاءَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَيْهَا / الْمَاءَ</span>","hinglish":"Us par pani","translations":{"en":"Upon it water","ur":"اس پر پانی","hi":"उस पर पानी"},"displayOrder":9},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s28","arabic":"عَلَيْهَا / الْمَوْتَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَيْهَا / الْمَوْتَ</span>","hinglish":"Us par maut","translations":{"en":"Upon it death","ur":"اس پر موت","hi":"उस पर मौत"},"displayOrder":10},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s29","arabic":"مِنْهَا / أَهْلَهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْهَا / أَهْلَهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein se uske ghar-wale","translations":{"en":"From it its people","ur":"اس میں سے اس کے گھر والے","hi":"उसमें से उसके घर वाले"},"displayOrder":11},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s30","arabic":"وَالرُّوحُ / فِيهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَالرُّوحُ / </span><span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span>","hinglish":"Aur rooh us mein","translations":{"en":"And the Spirit therein","ur":"اور روح اس میں","hi":"और रूह उसमें"},"displayOrder":12},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s31","arabic":"مِنْهَا / جَمِيعًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">جَمِيعًا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein se sab ke sab","translations":{"en":"From it, all together","ur":"اس میں سے سب کے سب","hi":"उसमें से सब के सब"},"displayOrder":13},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s32","arabic":"مِنْهَا / زَوْجَهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">زَوْجَهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein se uska joda","translations":{"en":"From it its mate","ur":"اس میں سے اس کا جوڑا","hi":"उसमें से उसका जोड़ा"},"displayOrder":14},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s33","arabic":"مِنْهَا / آيَةً بَيِّنَةً","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْهَا / آيَةً بَيِّنَةً</span>","hinglish":"Us mein se khuli daleel","translations":{"en":"From it a clear sign","ur":"اس میں سے کھلی دلیل (نشانی)","hi":"उसमें से खुली दलील (निशानी)"},"displayOrder":15,"ref":"29:35"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s34","arabic":"مِنْهَا / فِي شَكٍّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي شَكٍّ</span>","hinglish":"Us se shak mein","translations":{"en":"Concerning it in doubt","ur":"اس سے شک میں","hi":"उससे शक में"},"displayOrder":16,"ref":"34:21"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s35","arabic":"أَحْسَنَ / مِنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحْسَنَ / مِنْهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us se behtar","translations":{"en":"Better than it","ur":"اس سے بہتر","hi":"उससे बेहतर"},"displayOrder":17},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s36","arabic":"مِنْهَا / شَفَاعَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَفَاعَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us se sifarish","translations":{"en":"From it intercession","ur":"اس سے سفارش","hi":"उससे सिफ़ारिश"},"displayOrder":18},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s37","arabic":"إِنَّ فِيهَا / قَوْمًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمًا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak us mein ek qom hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, within it are a people","ur":"بیشک اس میں ایک قوم ہے","hi":"बेशक उसमें एक क़ौम है"},"displayOrder":19,"ref":"5:22"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s38","arabic":"خَيْرٌ مِنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us se behtar","translations":{"en":"Better than it","ur":"اس سے بہتر","hi":"उससे बेहतर"},"displayOrder":20},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s39","arabic":"اسْمَ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اسْمَ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهَا</span>","hinglish":"Allah ka naam us par","translations":{"en":"The name of Allah upon them","ur":"اللہ کا نام اس پر","hi":"अल्लाह का नाम उस पर"},"displayOrder":21},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s40","arabic":"لَهَا عَرْشُهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَرْشُهَا</span>","hinglish":"Uske liye uska arsh","translations":{"en":"For her is her throne","ur":"اس کے لیے اس کا تخت ہے","hi":"उसके लिए उसका तख़्त है"},"displayOrder":22},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s41","arabic":"لَهَا الْعَذَابُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَذَابُ</span>","hinglish":"Uske liye azab","translations":{"en":"For her the punishment","ur":"اس کے لیے عذاب","hi":"उसके लिए अज़ाब"},"displayOrder":23},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s42","arabic":"سَيِّئَةٌ مِثْلُهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَيِّئَةٌ مِثْلُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هَا</span>","hinglish":"Burai us jaisi","translations":{"en":"An evil like it","ur":"ویسی ہی برائی اس کی مانند","hi":"उसी जैसी बुराई उसकी मिसाल"},"displayOrder":24},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s43","arabic":"فِيهَا أَبَدًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَبَدًا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein hamesha","translations":{"en":"Therein forever","ur":"اس میں ہمیشہ","hi":"उसमें हमेशा"},"displayOrder":25},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s44","arabic":"لَهَا وَلِلْأَرْضِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلِلْأَرْضِ</span>","hinglish":"Uske liye aur zameen ke liye","translations":{"en":"To it and to the earth","ur":"اس کے لیے اور زمین کے لیے","hi":"उसके लिए और ज़मीन के लिए"},"displayOrder":26},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s45","arabic":"فِي شَكٍّ مِنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي شَكٍّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us se shak mein","translations":{"en":"In doubt concerning it","ur":"اس سے شک میں","hi":"उसके बारे में शक में"},"displayOrder":27,"ref":"27:66"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s46","arabic":"كُلٌّ فِيهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">كُلٌّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span>","hinglish":"Har ek us mein","translations":{"en":"Each in it","ur":"ہر ایک اس میں","hi":"हर एक उसमें"},"displayOrder":28},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s47","arabic":"نَصِيبٌ مِنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">نَصِيبٌ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein se hissa","translations":{"en":"A share thereof","ur":"اس میں سے ایک حصہ","hi":"उसमें से एक हिस्सा"},"displayOrder":29},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48","arabic":"لَهَا رِزْقًا كَرِيمًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">لَهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رِزْقًا كَرِيمًا</span>","hinglish":"Uske liye izzat wala rizq","translations":{"en":"For her an honorable provision","ur":"اس کے لیے عزت والا رزق","hi":"उसके लिए इज़्ज़त वाला रिज़्क़"},"displayOrder":30,"ref":"33:31"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48a","arabic":"فِيهَا / آيَاتٌ بَيِّنَاتٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">آيَاتٌ بَيِّنَاتٌ</span>","hinglish":"Is mein khuli nishaniyan hain","translations":{"en":"In it are clear signs","ur":"اس میں کھلی نشانیاں ہیں","hi":"इसमें खुली निशानियाँ हैं"},"displayOrder":31},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48b","arabic":"عَلَيْهَا / فِي نَارِ جَهَنَّمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَيْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي نَارِ جَهَنَّمَ</span>","hinglish":"Un par Jahannam ki aag mein","translations":{"en":"Over them in the fire of Hell","ur":"ان پر جہنم کی آگ میں","hi":"उन पर जहन्नम की आग में"},"displayOrder":32,"ref":"9:35"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48c","arabic":"مِثْلُهَا فِي الْبِلَادِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">مِثْلُهَا فِي الْبِلَادِ</span>","hinglish":"Jiske jaisa shahron mein (koi paida nahin kiya gaya)","translations":{"en":"The like of whom in the cities","ur":"جس کے جیسا شہروں میں","hi":"जिसके जैसा शहरों में"},"displayOrder":33,"ref":"89:8"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48d","arabic":"فِيهَا / مِنْ كُلِّ الثَّمَرَاتِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِنْ كُلِّ الثَّمَرَاتِ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein har qism ke phalon se","translations":{"en":"Therein of every kind of fruit","ur":"اس میں ہر قسم کے پھلوں سے","hi":"उसमें हर क़िस्म के फलों से"},"displayOrder":34},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48e","arabic":"فِيهَا / شَمْسًا وَلَا زَمْهَرِيرًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَمْسًا وَلَا زَمْهَرِيرًا</span>","hinglish":"Us mein na dhoop (garmi) dekhenge aur na sakht sardi","translations":{"en":"Therein neither burning sun nor freezing cold","ur":"اس میں نہ دھوپ اور نہ سخت سردی","hi":"उसमें न धूप और न सख़्त सर्दी"},"displayOrder":35,"ref":"76:13"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s48f","arabic":"وَعَلَيْهَا / وَعَلَى الْفُلْكِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">وَعَلَيْهَا</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَعَلَى الْ