,"ur":"اس سے اس کا پانی اور اس کا چارہ","hi":"उससे उसका पानी और उसका चारा"},"displayOrder":41,"ref":"79:31"}]}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Mukammal Qur'ani Jumlon aur Aayaat ka Tarjuma (1–50):","title":"Mukammal Qur'ani Jumle (1–50)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":3,"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s4l12_s3_s49","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"فِيهَا خَيْرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein bhalai hai","translations":{"en":"In them is good","ur":"اس میں بھلائی ہے","hi":"उसमें भलाई है"},"displayOrder":1},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s50","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"فِيهَا سَلَامٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein salamati hai","translations":{"en":"In it is peace","ur":"اس میں سلامتی ہے","hi":"उसमें सलामती है"},"displayOrder":2},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s51","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"فِيهَا الْقِتَالُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقِتَالُ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein qitaal hai","translations":{"en":"Fighting in it","ur":"اس میں قتال (لڑائی) ہے","hi":"उसमें क़िताल (लड़ाई) है"},"displayOrder":3,"ref":"47:20"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s52","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"فِيهَا مَتَاعٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَتَاعٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein faida hai","translations":{"en":"In it is enjoyment","ur":"اس میں فائدہ (ساز و سامان) ہے","hi":"उसमें फ़ायदा (सामान) है"},"displayOrder":4,"ref":"24:29"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s53","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"فِيهَا مِصْبَاحٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِصْبَاحٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein chiragh hai","translations":{"en":"Within it is a lamp","ur":"اس میں چراغ ہے","hi":"उसमें चिराग़ है"},"displayOrder":5,"ref":"24:35"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s54","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"فِيهَا فَوْجٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَوْجٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein giroh hai","translations":{"en":"A company in it","ur":"اس میں ایک گروہ ہے","hi":"उसमें एक गिरोह है"},"displayOrder":6,"ref":"67:8"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s55","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"فِيهَا كُتُبٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">كُتُبٌ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein kitabein hain","translations":{"en":"Within which are scriptures","ur":"اس میں کتابیں ہیں","hi":"उसमें किताबें हैं"},"displayOrder":7,"ref":"98:3"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s56","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"فَإِنَّهَا مُحَرَّمَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُحَرَّمَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Toh beshak woh haram karda hai","translations":{"en":"Then indeed, it is forbidden","ur":"تو بیشک وہ حرام کر دی گئی ہے","hi":"तो बेशक वह हराम कर दी गई है"},"displayOrder":8,"ref":"5:26"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s57","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"إِنَّ فِيهَا لُوطًا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لُوطًا</span>","hinglish":"Beshak us mein Loot (Alaihis Salam) hain","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Lot (peace be upon him) is in it","ur":"بیشک اس میں لوط (علیہ السلام) ہیں","hi":"बेशक उसमें लूत (अलैहिस्सलाम) हैं"},"displayOrder":9,"ref":"29:32"},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s58","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"فِيهَا مَنَافِعُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِيهَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَنَافِعُ</span>","hinglish":"Us mein nafe hain","translations":{"en":"In them are benefits","ur":"اس میں فائدے ہیں","hi":"उसमें फ़ायदे हैं"},"displayOrder":10},{"id":"s4l12_s3_s59","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"فَلَهُ خَيْرٌ مِنْهَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَلَهُ خَيْرٌ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مِنْهَا</span>","hinglish":"Toh uske liye us se behtar hai","translations":{"en":"Th